{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "conservatory.first_take",
  "title": "First Take",
  "status": "active",
  "entry": "start",
  "entries": [
    "start"
  ],
  "tags": [],
  "notes": "",
  "regions": [
    {
      "id": "conservatory.first_take.region",
      "title": "First Take",
      "kind": "scene",
      "color": "#245c62",
      "nodeIds": [
        "start",
        "floor.so",
        "floor.risers",
        "hub",
        "levels",
        "levels.floor",
        "room",
        "stand",
        "stand.take",
        "stand.leave",
        "slate",
        "dark",
        "roll"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "nodes": {
    "start": {
      "speaker": "STUDIO B3",
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "direction",
          "text": "Foam on three walls, carpet, a dead ceiling. This is by far the quietest room in the building.",
          "id": "start.line.1"
        },
        {
          "who": "direction",
          "text": "You put the rig down and start unwinding the cable.",
          "id": "start.line.2"
        },
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "...",
          "id": "start.line.3"
        },
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "I have set it on the floor.",
          "id": "start.line.4"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "so what? it is a floor",
          "goto": "floor.so",
          "id": "start.choice.1"
        },
        {
          "text": "pick it up. it goes on its risers.",
          "goto": "floor.risers",
          "id": "start.choice.2"
        }
      ],
      "id": "start",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    "floor.so": {
      "speaker": "STUDIO B3",
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "A floor is a drum. A joist is a drumstick. Everything above it and everything under it goes into the mic as one long low nothing you cannot filter out afterwards.",
          "id": "floor.so.line.1"
        },
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "That is why the case has four gum rubber risers on it. Silicone under those. I think it cost more than the microphone.",
          "id": "floor.so.line.2"
        },
        {
          "who": "direction",
          "text": "You have known that since your first week with the rig, but you're nervous, making excuses.",
          "id": "floor.so.line.3"
        }
      ],
      "goto": "floor.risers",
      "id": "floor.so",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    "floor.risers": {
      "speaker": "STUDIO B3",
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "direction",
          "text": "You lift it, set it on the case, and feel the risers take it.",
          "id": "floor.risers.line.1"
        },
        {
          "who": "direction",
          "text": "You have quickly fixed your first mistake of the night. You get the feeling you need to be extra careful from here on out.",
          "id": "floor.risers.line.4"
        }
      ],
      "goto": "hub",
      "id": "floor.risers",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    "hub": {
      "speaker": "STUDIO B3",
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "Right. Do it properly. Set up, levels, light, roll.",
          "id": "hub.line.1"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "check the levels",
          "goto": "levels",
          "id": "hub.choice.1"
        },
        {
          "text": "look at the room",
          "goto": "room",
          "id": "hub.choice.2"
        },
        {
          "text": "the music stand",
          "goto": "stand",
          "id": "hub.choice.3"
        },
        {
          "text": "slate it, out loud",
          "goto": "slate",
          "id": "hub.choice.4"
        },
        {
          "text": "kill the light and roll",
          "goto": "dark",
          "id": "hub.choice.5"
        }
      ],
      "id": "hub",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    "levels": {
      "speaker": "STUDIO B3",
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "direction",
          "text": "The meter finds the room. Minus sixty-one.",
          "id": "levels.line.1"
        },
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "And the last two decibels of that are me. Jacket, knee, breathing — which you cannot switch off, only slow down.",
          "id": "levels.line.2"
        },
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "Minus sixty-one in a room with a man in it. This place is a coffin with foam on it.",
          "id": "levels.line.3"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "what is a good floor?",
          "goto": "levels.floor",
          "id": "levels.choice.1"
        },
        {
          "text": "back",
          "goto": "hub",
          "id": "levels.choice.2"
        }
      ],
      "id": "levels",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    "levels.floor": {
      "speaker": "STUDIO B3",
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "A live room is minus fifty. A church at four in the morning is minus fifty-five and you are proud of it.",
          "id": "levels.floor.line.1"
        },
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "Minus sixty-one is a number I have seen twice. Once in an anechoic chamber in Salford.",
          "id": "levels.floor.line.2"
        },
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "And once on a file the client sent me this afternoon.",
          "id": "levels.floor.line.3"
        },
        {
          "who": "direction",
          "text": "Minus fifty-eight, that one. Close enough that it does not comfort you.",
          "id": "levels.floor.line.4"
        }
      ],
      "goto": "hub",
      "id": "levels.floor",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    "room": {
      "speaker": "STUDIO B3",
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "direction",
          "text": "The torch goes round it. Cable snakes, coiled the way you coil them, which is the way everybody coils them.",
          "id": "room.line.1"
        },
        {
          "who": "direction",
          "text": "A patchbay with every cable pulled. A chair. Foam gone brown at the edges where thirty years of hands went past it.",
          "id": "room.line.2"
        },
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "Somebody worked in here for a long time and then one day they did not come back.",
          "id": "room.line.3"
        },
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "That is not ominous. That is every building I have ever been paid to record.",
          "id": "room.line.4"
        }
      ],
      "goto": "hub",
      "id": "room",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    "stand": {
      "speaker": "STUDIO B3",
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "direction",
          "text": "A music stand, folded down, leaning in the corner. Somebody folded it. Nobody folds a stand on the day a building is condemned.",
          "id": "stand.line.1"
        },
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "They thought they were coming back. Everyone in a condemned building thought they were coming back.",
          "id": "stand.line.2"
        },
        {
          "who": "direction",
          "text": "There is a sheet still clipped to it. Two bars of something, in pencil, in a hand you cannot read.",
          "id": "stand.line.3"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "take it",
          "goto": "stand.take",
          "id": "stand.choice.1"
        },
        {
          "text": "leave it",
          "goto": "stand.leave",
          "id": "stand.choice.2"
        }
      ],
      "id": "stand",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    "stand.take": {
      "speaker": "STUDIO B3",
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "direction",
          "text": "You put it in the bag, behind the work order, and you could not tell anybody why.",
          "id": "stand.take.line.1"
        },
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "It comes down on Thursday. All of it. Somebody may as well have the two bars.",
          "id": "stand.take.line.2"
        }
      ],
      "goto": "hub",
      "id": "stand.take",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    "stand.leave": {
      "speaker": "STUDIO B3",
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "Not mine. None of this is mine. I am here for sixty seconds of the air.",
          "id": "stand.leave.line.1"
        },
        {
          "who": "direction",
          "text": "You leave it exactly as you found it, which is a thing you are good at.",
          "id": "stand.leave.line.2"
        }
      ],
      "goto": "hub",
      "id": "stand.leave",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    "slate": {
      "speaker": "STUDIO B3",
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "me",
          "text": "Ellery, studio B3, room tone, take one.",
          "prompt": "slate it: \"Ellery, studio B3, room tone, take one.\"",
          "id": "slate.line.1"
        },
        {
          "who": "direction",
          "text": "Your own voice comes back off the foam with everything above four hundred hertz taken out of it.",
          "id": "slate.line.2"
        },
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "You slate out loud so that in eight months, when the file is a number, somebody knows what they are listening to.",
          "id": "slate.line.3"
        },
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "I stopped doing it years ago, when the recorders started writing the metadata themselves.",
          "id": "slate.line.4"
        },
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "The last man slated three of his four.",
          "id": "slate.line.5"
        },
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "And while my voice is in the room. There is a thing I did not say by the door, when I could not find the door.",
          "id": "slate.line.confess",
          "if": "!confession.kind"
        }
      ],
      "id": "slate",
      "type": "choice",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "\"I want to hear that natatorium. Six metres of tile and no water.\"",
          "goto": "hub",
          "id": "slate.choice.craft",
          "if": "!confession.kind",
          "mutations": {
            "set": [
              "confession.kind=reason",
              "confession.value=craft"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Four hundred quid. I am not walking out on a paid job.\"",
          "goto": "hub",
          "id": "slate.choice.money",
          "if": "!confession.kind",
          "mutations": {
            "set": [
              "confession.kind=reason",
              "confession.value=money"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Sarah'll have gone up. She won't check the drive till morning.\"",
          "goto": "hub",
          "id": "slate.choice.sarah",
          "if": "!confession.kind",
          "mutations": {
            "set": [
              "confession.kind=name",
              "confession.value=Sarah"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "(slate it and nothing else. that is what a slate is for.)",
          "goto": "hub",
          "id": "slate.choice.nothing",
          "if": "!confession.kind",
          "mutations": {
            "set": [
              "confession.kind=nothing"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "back",
          "goto": "hub",
          "id": "slate.choice.back",
          "if": "confession.kind"
        }
      ]
    },
    "dark": {
      "speaker": "STUDIO B3",
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "The torch is a filament, and a filament in a dead building is a bell. Off it goes.",
          "id": "dark.line.1"
        },
        {
          "who": "direction",
          "text": "Dark. The kind with no shape in it, because there is nothing here to make a shape out of.",
          "id": "dark.line.2"
        },
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "Forty-five seconds. Do not move. Do not touch the light.",
          "id": "dark.line.3"
        },
        {
          "who": "you",
          "text": "If I can hear myself on the take, the take is not the room. Their words. Mine first.",
          "id": "dark.line.4"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "wait — go back over the kit",
          "goto": "hub",
          "id": "dark.choice.1"
        },
        {
          "text": "roll",
          "goto": "roll",
          "id": "dark.choice.2"
        }
      ],
      "id": "dark",
      "type": "choice"
    },
    "roll": {
      "speaker": "STUDIO B3",
      "lines": [
        {
          "who": "direction",
          "text": "The monitor opens. The room comes up in the cans, close and quiet — the foam, the dead air, the size of it.",
          "id": "roll.line.1"
        },
        {
          "who": "direction",
          "text": "Headphones on. Press [r] to roll — and the moment you do, the room drops out, and you do not move.",
          "id": "roll.line.2"
        }
      ],
      "id": "roll",
      "type": "dialogue"
    }
  }
}
